From 34a5047a347118a5348219ccbef459c2dbe1c588 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Viswanath Kraleti <viswanath.kraleti@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 14:44:47 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] linux-firmware: revert qcs615 ADSP firmware to fix audio
 regressions

The linux-firmware 20260910 release carries 5aeb5a22d894 ("qcom:
update ADSP firmware for qcs615 platform"), which regresses audio on
Talos (qcs615) after SVA activation.

Upstream has since reverted that update in 5e7b5bc6a938 (Revert "qcom:
update ADSP firmware for qcs615 platform"), which lands after the
20260910 release. Backport that revert so qcs615 boards get the known
good ADSP firmware, rather than waiting for OE-Core to move past it.

Link: https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/firmware/linux-firmware.git/commit/?id=5e7b5bc6a938f8d222b9283873c97be3d4a36c43

Signed-off-by: Viswanath Kraleti <viswanath.kraleti@oss.qualcomm.com>
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [meta-qcom specific]
---
 ...te-ADSP-firmware-for-qcs615-platform.patch | 24613 ++++++++++++++++
 .../linux-firmware/linux-firmware_20260910.bb |     3 +-
 2 files changed, 24615 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 meta/recipes-kernel/linux-firmware/linux-firmware/0001-Revert-qcom-update-ADSP-firmware-for-qcs615-platform.patch

diff --git a/meta/recipes-kernel/linux-firmware/linux-firmware/0001-Revert-qcom-update-ADSP-firmware-for-qcs615-platform.patch b/meta/recipes-kernel/linux-firmware/linux-firmware/0001-Revert-qcom-update-ADSP-firmware-for-qcs615-platform.patch
